{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028490/extras/7b4d3fa2b80f386ccebdf23ca037d711.poster.avif?t=1767634970\" width=832 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028490/extras/7b4d3fa2b80f386ccebdf23ca037d711.webm?t=1767634970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028490/extras/7b4d3fa2b80f386ccebdf23ca037d711.mp4?t=1767634970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A cute Tiny 3D Platformer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Candle World is a 3D-Platformer and Collect-a-Thon, in a colorful cartoon look. The Candle King wants you to gather all golden cookies for him, so go on an adventure, explore colorful islands, discover marvelous secrets in this short game inspired by classics, like Super Mario 64 or Astrobot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028490/extras/deb700b3ed877ef7aabf602851f4b9a7.poster.avif?t=1767634970\" width=892 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028490/extras/deb700b3ed877ef7aabf602851f4b9a7.webm?t=1767634970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028490/extras/deb700b3ed877ef7aabf602851f4b9a7.mp4?t=1767634970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful world to explore\u00a0\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Candle can jump, fly, attack and run everywhere!\u00a0</p><